<title>BELGIUM: EU intvn soft wheat stocks lower at 338,494 tns.</title>
<headline>EU intvn soft wheat stocks lower at 338,494 tns.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union intervention soft wheat stocks totalled 338,494 tonnes at the end of the 1996/97 intervention season, down from 458,978 tonnes at the start of the season, the European Commission said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
